    supportingExcerpts[3]: "Check if your Bangladesh TIN is selected for NBR Risk-Based Audit (AY 2023-24). Client-side, private, instant lookup of 72,342 returns.\n\nfalse\n2026-04-30T09:35:36Z\n7d915fdb881c99faea75b5ce829d15dce17359ba\n2026-04-30T11:59:39Z\nhttps://github.com/montasim/tin-audit-checker\nproject-tin-audit-checker\nassets/projects/tin-audit-checker.png\nhttps://tin-audit-checker.netlify.app\n\nNext.js\nReact\nTypeScript\nTailwind CSS\nshadcn/ui\nJSON\nSheetJS\nTIN Audit Checker -","A static historical audit list is inconvenient to search manually, especially on mobile, while submitting a tax identifier to another application server creates avoidable query exposure.\nThe data is historical, not live audit/compliance status.\nClaimed NBR provenance, accuracy, completeness, and redistribution rights are not established.\nShipping the dataset to browsers makes records retrievable even though lookup queries stay client-side.","Users can search the historical list quickly.\nLookup text is not submitted to an application API.\nMatches return bounded mapped details.\nNon-matches and matches are both framed as requiring current official confirmation."
