  - id: "case-study:b4joinacompany:architecture"
    category: case-study
    question: How did Montasim structure the b4joinacompany solution?
    text: "Versioned source files feed a deterministic research layer. The web product and versioned API consume the same evidence model, while private checkpoints live separately in MongoDB. A representative decision was “Preserve provenance at the record level”: Reported, submitted, derived, and official information stay distinct, with source URLs and capture context retained for review. The value of this architecture is the reasoning behind it—Montasim connects a real constraint to an explicit boundary that another developer can review, test, and evolve."
