  - id: "case-study:thoughtline:delivery"
    category: case-study
    question: What did Montasim deliver and achieve with Thoughtline - LinkedIn Writing Assistant?
    text: "Montasim implemented reply, idea, refine, history, settings, and onboarding journeys. He built content extraction and validated prompt envelopes. He added manual four-direction replies, model provenance, and visible provider recovery states. He added encrypted credential storage, migrations/recovery/retention, configuration backup, and data archives. He established static, unit, packed-extension, Axe, responsive, and visual-regression gates. The resulting capabilities and outcomes are “Users can paste a post or select a visible conversation and draft four reply directions”; “Generate/refine post ideas in configured voice”; “Use a fixed free-only OpenRouter, Gemini, and Groq route under defined fallback rules”; “Export and restore validated configurations and history”. This gives a reviewer a traceable line from Montasim's implementation work to the product capabilities and limits that followed."
