    text: "Montasim implemented named counter increment/read behavior. He built configurable escaped SVG output. He added health/status/uptime reporting. He documented embedding, configuration, persistence, and deployment limitations. The resulting capabilities and outcomes are “Users can self-host an embeddable counter”; “Customize the generated badge”; “Keep separate counters by identifier”; “Monitor basic process health”. This gives a reviewer a traceable line from Montasim's implementation work to the product capabilities and limits that followed."
