  - id: "experience:experience-mymedicalhub-senior-software-engineer:responsibility"
    category: experience
    question: What did Montasim do as Senior Software Engineer at MyMedicalHub International Ltd.?
    text: "As Senior Software Engineer at MyMedicalHub International Ltd. (Oct 2025 - Present), Montasim architected an FSM-based biometric engine replacing unstable React hooks with deterministic state transitions for 99.9% reliability during AI analysis. He optimized AI pipelines to support 60 FPS pose estimation and real-time rep counting via adaptive frame rate logic. He led a full rewrite of the medical assessment chatbot with Redux Toolkit and refactored 54+ modules into Presentational/Container pattern. For a hiring manager, this is role-specific evidence of what he owned, delivered, or improved at that stage of his career—not a title-only claim."
    factIds[1]: "experience:experience-mymedicalhub-senior-software-engineer"
    supportingExcerpts[1]: "MyMedicalHub International Ltd.\nhttps://mymedicalhub.com\nArchitected an **FSM-based biometric engine** replacing unstable React hooks with deterministic state transitions for **99.9% reliability** during AI analysis. Optimized **AI pipelines** to support **60 FPS** pose estimation and real-time rep counting via adaptive frame rate logic. Led a full rewrite of the **medical assessment chatbot** with Redux Toolkit and refactored **54+ modules** into Presentational/Container"
