    category: experience
    question: What did Montasim do as Software Engineer at MyMedicalHub International Ltd.?
    text: "As Software Engineer at MyMedicalHub International Ltd. (Oct 2023 - Sep 2025), Montasim boosted application performance by 40% by stripping legacy UI libraries and optimizing React rendering cycles. He achieved 70% infrastructure cost reduction by migrating Azure VMs to App Service and automating CI/CD pipelines. He deployed a HIPAA-compliant SSO system with multi-role access, OAuth integration, and strict CSP headers. For a hiring manager, this is role-specific evidence of what he owned, delivered, or improved at that stage of his career—not a title-only claim."
