    question: Why should a hiring manager consider Montasim for a senior engineering role?
    text: "Montasim combines documented progression with measurable production ownership: two promotions at MyMedicalHub, frontend architecture leadership, PR reviews, mentoring, 99.9% reliable real-time AI at 60 FPS, a 40% performance gain, and a 70% cloud-cost reduction. That mix makes him a strong evidence-backed senior candidate for complex product teams."
    factIds[3]: profile,"experience:experience-mymedicalhub-senior-software-engineer","experience:experience-mymedicalhub-software-engineer"
    supportingExcerpts[3]: "Most software looks great in the demo. I build the kind that survives production.\n\nI'm a **Senior Software Engineer** with **3+ years** building real-time, AI-driven, multi-tenant SaaS platforms across the full stack: React, Next.js, Node.js, and TypeScript. Promoted twice at the same company, I now own frontend architecture across a multi-service platform, lead PR reviews, and mentor the engineers behind me.\n\nKey highlights: cut cloud infrastructure costs **70%** by migrating Azure VMs to App Service with","MyMedicalHub International Ltd.\nhttps://mymedicalhub.com\nArchitected an **FSM-based biometric engine** replacing unstable React hooks with deterministic state transitions for **99.9% reliability** during AI analysis. Optimized **AI pipelines** to support **60 FPS** pose estimation and real-time rep counting via adaptive frame rate logic. Led a full rewrite of the **medical assessment chatbot** with Redux Toolkit and refactored **54+ modules** into Presentational/Container","MyMedicalHub International Ltd.\nhttps://mymedicalhub.com\nBoosted application performance by **40%** by stripping legacy UI libraries and optimizing React rendering cycles. Achieved **70% infrastructure cost reduction** by migrating Azure VMs to App Service and automating CI/CD pipelines. Deployed a **HIPAA-compliant SSO system** with multi-role access, OAuth integration, and strict CSP headers.\nexperience-mymedicalhub-software-engineer\nMohakhali, Dhaka, Bangladesh\nM\n/images/organizations/mymedicalhub.png\nOct 2023"
