  - id: "technical-depth:frontend-architecture"
    category: technical-depth
    question: What is Montasim's strongest frontend-architecture example?
    text: "His healthcare biometric engine is the strongest professional example: Montasim replaced more than 40 unstable effect-driven interactions with a finite-state machine, creating deterministic transitions and reaching 99.9% reliability. The same role includes Redux Toolkit and a Presentational/Container refactor across 54+ chatbot modules."
    factIds[3]: "experience:experience-mymedicalhub-senior-software-engineer",profile,"blog:from-useeffect-chaos-to-deterministic-systems"
    supportingExcerpts[3]: "MyMedicalHub International Ltd.\nhttps://mymedicalhub.com\nArchitected an **FSM-based biometric engine** replacing unstable React hooks with deterministic state transitions for **99.9% reliability** during AI analysis. Optimized **AI pipelines** to support **60 FPS** pose estimation and real-time rep counting via adaptive frame rate logic. Led a full rewrite of the **medical assessment chatbot** with Redux Toolkit and refactored **54+ modules** into Presentational/Container","Most software looks great in the demo. I build the kind that survives production.\n\nI'm a **Senior Software Engineer** with **3+ years** building real-time, AI-driven, multi-tenant SaaS platforms across the full stack: React, Next.js, Node.js, and TypeScript. Promoted twice at the same company, I now own frontend architecture across a multi-service platform, lead PR reviews, and mentor the engineers behind me.\n\nKey highlights: cut cloud infrastructure costs **70%** by migrating Azure VMs to App Service with","Architecture\nI deleted 40+ useEffects and replaced them with a Finite State Machine. That was the best decision I made for our biometric assessment pipeline.\nfalse\nA deterministic state machine coordinating a real-time biometric assessment pipeline\n/images/blog/deterministic-systems.png\nauthored\n2026-05-16\n3\nfrom-useeffect-chaos-to-deterministic-systems\nFrom useEffect Chaos to Deterministic Systems: Why I Rebuilt Our Biometric Pipeline with a Finite State Machine\nproduct"
  - id: "technical-depth:full-stack-evidence"
    category: technical-depth
    question: Which records demonstrate Montasim's full-stack range?
    text: "His role history includes React, Node.js, Express, PostgreSQL, JWT, WebRTC, Azure, Docker, and CI/CD. Project records add Next.js, MongoDB, Prisma, Drizzle, Better Auth, queues, scheduled jobs, email, APIs, and multiple AI providers, with case studies explaining how those parts are bounded."
    factIds[5]: "experience:experience-mymedicalhub-junior-software-engineer","experience:experience-mymedicalhub-software-engineer","skills:skills-backend-apis","skills:skills-databases","project:project-postcraft"
    supportingExcerpts[5]: "MyMedicalHub International Ltd.\nhttps://mymedicalhub.com\nReduced patient diagnosis time by **25%** and achieved **95% accuracy** by integrating **real-time AI analysis** and custom algorithms. Integrated a **WebRTC video pipeline** stabilizing remote consultations and reducing call latency. Developed a **JWT-based REST API client layer** with built-in XSS and CSRF protection.\nexperience-mymedicalhub-junior-software-engineer\nUttara, Dhaka, Bangladesh\nM\n/images/organizations/mymedicalhub.png\nSep 2022 - Sep","MyMedicalHub International Ltd.\nhttps://mymedicalhub.com\nBoosted application performance by **40%** by stripping legacy UI libraries and optimizing React rendering cycles. Achieved **70% infrastructure cost reduction** by migrating Azure VMs to App Service and automating CI/CD pipelines. Deployed a **HIPAA-compliant SSO system** with multi-role access, OAuth integration, and strict CSP headers.\nexperience-mymedicalhub-software-engineer\nMohakhali, Dhaka, Bangladesh\nM\n/images/organizations/mymedicalhub.png\nOct 2023","Backend & APIs\nskills-backend-apis\nNode.js\nExpress.js\nSocket.io\nREST APIs\nBetter Auth\nNextAuth\nZod\nBullMQ\nInngest\nWeb Push\nResend\nStripe\nGoogle Drive API\nPython\nPHP","Databases & ORM\nskills-databases\nPostgreSQL\nMongoDB\nPrisma\nDrizzle ORM\nMongoose\nRedis\nSQLite\nPhpMyAdmin","AI-powered social media manager to generate, preview, score, and auto-publish engaging posts for LinkedIn, X, and Facebook using Gemini AI and custom brand guardrails.\n\ntrue\n2026-05-21T22:57:30Z\n664e1557c35eebde3bdb3a106447b4716e103b2c\n2026-05-26T16:29:25Z\nhttps://github.com/montasim/PostCraft\nproject-postcraft\nassets/projects/postcraft.png\nhttps://aipostcraft.vercel.app\n\nNext.js\nReact\nTypeScript\nMongoDB\nMongoose\nRedux Toolkit\nBetter Auth\nOpenRouter\nGemini API\nGroq API\nZhipuAI\nInngest\nREST APIs\nTailwind"
