    text: "React appears across his professional progression from responsive telemedicine components to rendering optimization, deterministic biometric state, Redux Toolkit, and a 54+ module architecture refactor. His projects extend that experience into Next.js, browser extensions, React Three Fiber, and reusable component systems."
    factIds[4]: "experience:experience-multiversal-junior-frontend-developer","experience:experience-mymedicalhub-software-engineer","experience:experience-mymedicalhub-senior-software-engineer","skills:skills-frontend"
    supportingExcerpts[4]: "Multiversal Software Ltd.\n\nBuilt and maintained **UI components** for a telemedicine platform using React.js, JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3, improving user experience across devices. Debugged and optimized front-end code, **reducing page load time** and enhancing performance stability.\nexperience-multiversal-junior-frontend-developer\nUttara, Dhaka, Bangladesh\nM\n/images/organizations/multiversal.jpg\nAug 2022 - Oct 2022\nJunior Frontend Developer\nReact.js\nJavaScript\nHTML5\nCSS3\njQuery","MyMedicalHub International Ltd.\nhttps://mymedicalhub.com\nBoosted application performance by **40%** by stripping legacy UI libraries and optimizing React rendering cycles. Achieved **70% infrastructure cost reduction** by migrating Azure VMs to App Service and automating CI/CD pipelines. Deployed a **HIPAA-compliant SSO system** with multi-role access, OAuth integration, and strict CSP headers.\nexperience-mymedicalhub-software-engineer\nMohakhali, Dhaka, Bangladesh\nM\n/images/organizations/mymedicalhub.png\nOct 2023","MyMedicalHub International Ltd.\nhttps://mymedicalhub.com\nArchitected an **FSM-based biometric engine** replacing unstable React hooks with deterministic state transitions for **99.9% reliability** during AI analysis. Optimized **AI pipelines** to support **60 FPS** pose estimation and real-time rep counting via adaptive frame rate logic. Led a full rewrite of the **medical assessment chatbot** with Redux Toolkit and refactored **54+ modules** into Presentational/Container","Frontend\nskills-frontend\nReact.js\nNext.js\nTypeScript\nJavaScript\nHTML5\nCSS\nTailwind CSS\nRedux.js\nTanStack Start\nTanStack Query\nReact Three Fiber\nThree.js\nDrei\nReact Three Rapier\nshadcn/ui\nRadix UI\nReact Hook Form\nReact Markdown\nCodeMirror 6\nnext-intl\nVite\nBootstrap\njQuery\nResponsive Web Design\nKonva.js"
